    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 1 of the Foreign Exchange Act, No. 12 of 2017, I, Ranil Wickramasinghe,Minister of National Policies and Economic Affairs, do by this Order appoint November 20, 2017 as the date on whichthe aforesaid Act shall come into operation.",
